{* The keyboard shortcuts tab of the settings dialog, listed for the platform the app runs on
	(Shortcuts.php). ? opens the dialog straight on it (javascript/shortcuts.js). Read-only: no
	field here posts anything.

	A table per group, not one table with a thead per group: the panels' thead is sticky, and two
	in one table stick over each other's rows. *}
{parameters
	array $rows
}
<table n:foreach="$rows as $group => $shortcuts" class="odds">
	<thead><tr><th colspan="2">{$group}</th></tr></thead>
	<tbody>
		<tr n:foreach="$shortcuts as [$label, $combos]">
			<td>{$label}</td>
			<td><kbd n:foreach="$combos as $combo">{$combo}</kbd></td>
		</tr>
	</tbody>
</table>
